                                "sense_id": "c08344a2-e89e-30c4-a2de-d932794b209d",
                                "text": "There is something very horrible in the laugh of a dying man: Hovering on the verge of both worlds, he seems to give the lie to both, and proclaim the enjoyments of one, and the hopes of another, alike an imposture."
                            }
